WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.430
- You grew up coming to Universal Studios

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.600
and now you work at Universal Studios.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.750
That's kind of trippy.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.020
- It's such a trip.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:11.500
I grew up in L.A. and as a kid
we'd come and ride the tram

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.050
and it was just magic.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:18.050
It was just oh my god, one day
maybe I'll get to make movies

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:23.450
or make TV and now every
day about 100 times a day

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.260
the tram goes right by my trailer

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.710
and goes "Starring America Ferrera!"

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.120
- That's amazing!
(audience applauds)

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.600
- It's sort of like the
first time in the day

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.360
I'm welling up and remembering being a kid

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.577
and by the 100th time in the day I'm like,

00:00:37.577 --> 00:00:40.370
"Oh my god, I don't wanna
hear my name anymore."

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:42.550
- It's really cool and a novelty at first.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.900
Then you're like, "Cool,
it's still happening."

